+    # For each piece from the regex:
+    #   The piece starts at `piece_start_char_index`.
+    #   The piece is a string.
+    #   We convert the piece to bytes.
+    #   We map each byte to a character index.
+    #   We apply BPE to the bytes to get tokens.
+    #   For each token, the position is the character index of the first byte of the token.
