+# Token 19010: b'\xc3\xa9l' -> bytes 1, 2, 3 -> char 1, 1, 2. Starts at byte 1 -> char 1.
+# Token 385: b'lo' -> bytes 4, 5 -> char 3, 4. Starts at byte 4 -> char 3.
+
+# This seems to be the correct logic!
